1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,190
One day, Andare's family was invited to a nearby village wedding.

2
00:00:04,380 --> 00:00:06,850
Little Andare wanted to go too, of course.

3
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:11,490
Knowing how mischievous he could be, his mother had no intention of taking him.

4
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:14,570
As she was getting ready to leave, Andare spoke up.

5
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:18,110
Andare: "I want to go to the wedding too!"

6
00:00:18,340 --> 00:00:23,110
Mother: "Fine, I'll take you, but on one condition.

7
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:27,930
When we get there, you must stay outside and behave like a bull ("be as quiet as a mouse"), without a word."

8
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:31,150
Andare agreed, and they set off for the wedding.

9
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:34,990
Upon arriving, his mother left him outside and stepped into the house.

10
00:00:35,240 --> 00:00:39,810
Mother: "Thank goodness. My son is actually being good today,

11
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:41,790
he's doing just what I told him."

12
00:00:42,380 --> 00:00:47,530
Not long after, a huge commotion broke out in front of the wedding house!

13
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:51,370
Alarmed, Andare's mother came running out to see what was going on.

14
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:56,160
And what did she find? There was Andare, on his hands and knees,

15
00:00:56,180 --> 00:01:02,050
charging around and headbutting everyone, men and women, young and old alike!

16
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:07,150
He was tilting his head side to side, rolling his eyes, and ramming into people.

17
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:09,850
She rushed over and grabbed hold of him at once.

18
00:01:10,080 --> 00:01:14,530
Mother: "What on earth are you doing, son?

19
00:01:14,900 --> 00:01:17,930
Have you forgotten what I told you before we came here?"

20
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:20,850
Andare: "I remember, Mother."

21
00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:24,870
Mother: "Then why are you bothering all these people?"

22
00:01:25,080 --> 00:01:29,710
Andare: "Well, you're the one who told me to behave like a bull! ("be as quiet as a mouse")

23
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:34,990
So I remembered what you said and started headbutting people just like one!"

24
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:38,710
At that, everyone burst out laughing.

